22\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(22,4,11)\">Song 4:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> usually as organ of speech, both good and bad (especially Psalms, Proverbs, often || <bdbheb>פֶּה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>שָׂפָה</bdbheb>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּבַד ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 4:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,4,10)\">Exod 4:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>heavy of tongue</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַעֲנֵה ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 16:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,1)\">Prov 16:1</ref>, <bdbheb>מִלָּתוֺ עַללְֿשׁוֺנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,2)\">2Sam 23:2</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Prov 31:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,26)\">Prov 31:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 139:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,4)\">Ps 139:4</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בִּל</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>הֲיֵשׁ בִּלְשׁוֺנִי עַוְלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 6:30\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,30)\">Job 6:30</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מָוֶת וְחַיִּים בְּיַד ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 18:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,21)\">Prov 18:21</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Prov 21:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,23)\">Prov 21:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 25:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,15)\">Prov 25:15</ref> of (false) prophets, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַלֹּקְהִים ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:31\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,31)\">Jer 23:31</ref> subject of verb of speaking, <bdbheb>בֶּר</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> — <bdbheb>בִחִכִּי דִּבְּרָה לְשׁוֺנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 33:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,2)\">Job 33:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 12:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,12,4)\">Ps 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 37:30\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(19,37,30)\">Ps 37:30</ref> compare (<ref ref=\"Jer 9:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,7)\">Jer 9:7</ref> below and) <bdbheb>֗֗֗ תְּמַהֵר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לְדַבֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 32:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,4)\">Isa 32:4</ref>, <bdbheb>לְשׁוֺנִי עֵט סֹפֵר מָהִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 45:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,2)\">Ps 45:2</ref>, i.e. as swift as a rapid scribe's stylus; subject of <bdbheb>הָגָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 59:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,3)\">Isa 59:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 27:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,4)\">Job 27:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:28\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,28)\">Ps 35:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,24)\">Ps 71:24</ref> subject of <bdbheb>נִשְׁבַּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 45:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,23)\">Isa 45:23</ref> <bdbheb>תִּהַלַךְ בָּאָרֶץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 73:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,9)\">Ps 73:9</ref> of hostile speech, insolence, etc., <ref ref=\"Josh 10:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,21)\">Josh 10:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; object of I.  <bdbheb><reflink>חָרַץ</reflink></bdbheb> q. v., compare <b>3</b> below), <ref ref=\"Jer 18:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,18)\">Jer 18:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 3:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,8)\">Isa 3:8</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>זַעַם ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:16\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,16)\">Hos 7:16</ref> (but text dubious, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup>), <bdbheb>חֶרֶב חַדָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 57:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,57,6)\">Ps 57:6</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 64:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,64,4)\">Ps 64:4</ref> <bdbheb>כְּמוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נָחָשׁ שָֽׁנְנוּ ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 140:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"140\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"140\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,140,4)\">Ps 140:4</ref> <bdbheb>תָּקוּם אִתָּךְ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כָּללֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 54:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,54,17)\">Isa 54:17</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֶאֱרִיךְ ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 57:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,4)\">Isa 57:4</ref> further, <ref ref=\"Jer 9:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,2)\">Jer 9:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 9:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,4)\">Jer 9:4</ref> as instrument of seductive flattery (<bdbheb>הֶחֱלִיק</bdbheb>), without <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 5:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,5,10)\">Ps 5:10</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Prov 28:33\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,33)\">Prov 28:33</ref>, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נָכְרִיָּה חֶלְקַת לָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,24)\">Prov 6:24</ref>. of falsehood <ref ref=\"Ps 78:36\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,36)\">Ps 78:36</ref> (compare below); of slander (compare <bdbheb>לושֵׁן</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רָגַל עַללֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 15:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,15,3)\">Ps 15:3</ref>, <bdbheb>אִישׁ לָשׁוֺן</bdbheb><ref ref=\"Ps 140:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"140\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"140\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,140,12)\">Ps 140:12</ref>, compare <bdbheb>סָ֑תֶר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Prov 25:33\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,33)\">Prov 25:33</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חָטָא בְּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 39:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,2)\">Ps 39:2</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Ps 64:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,64,9)\">Ps 64:9</ref> (text dubious, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup>); moral qualities ascribed to: — as arrogant <ref ref=\"Ps 12:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,12,5)\">Ps 12:5</ref> (compare v<ref ref=\"Ps 12:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,12,4)\">Ps 12:4</ref> above); as devising injuries, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַוּוֺת תַּחְשֹׁב ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 52:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,4)\">Ps 52:4</ref>, compare <bdbheb>הַוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,4)\">Prov 17:4</ref> <bdbheb>תַּצְמִיד מִרְמָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 50:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,19)\">Ps 50:19</ref> <highlight>nectere fraudem</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֵרָ֑ע נְצֹר ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 34:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,34,14)\">Ps 34:14</ref> <bdbheb>ׅ</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>(וּשְׂפָתֶיךָ מִדַּבֵּר מִרְמָה</bdbheb>; often of lying tongue: <bdbheb>לְשׁוֺן שֶׁקֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,17)\">Prov 6:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 12:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,19)\">Prov 12:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 21:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,6)\">Prov 21:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 26:28\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,28)\">Prov 26:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 109:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"109\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"109\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,109,2)\">Ps 109:2</ref> <bdbheb>מִרְמָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 52:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,6)\">Ps 52:6</ref> <bdbheb>רְמִיָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 6:12\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,12)\">Mic 6:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 120:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"120\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"120\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,120,2)\">Ps 120:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 120:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"120\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"120\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,120,3)\">Ps 120:3</ref> <bdbheb>תַּרְמִית</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:13\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,13)\">Zeph 3:13</ref> <bdbheb>תַּהְפֻּכוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:31\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,31)\">Prov 10:31</ref>, and <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֶהְפָּךְ בִּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 17:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,20)\">Prov 17:20</ref> <bdbheb>עֲרוּמִים</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 15:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,5)\">Job 15:5</ref> also <bdbheb>מִרְמָה דִּבֵּ֑ר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 9:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,7)\">Jer 9:7</ref> on the other hand <bdbheb>צַדִּיק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,20)\">Prov 10:20</ref> <bdbheb>חֲכָמִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 12:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,18)\">Prov 12:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 15:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,2)\">Prov 15:2</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַרְפֵּה לָ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Prov 15:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,4)\">Prov 15:4</ref> <bdbheb>לִמּוּדִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 50:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,50,4)\">Isa 50:4</ref>. — Note phrases <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁוֺט ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 5:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,21)\">Job 5:21</ref> <highlight>scourge of</highlight> (the) <highlight>tongue</highlight>, <bdbheb>רִיב לְשֹׁנוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 31:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,21)\">Ps 31:21</ref> <bdbheb>פַּלַּג לְשׁוֺנָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 55:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,55,10)\">Ps 55:10</ref>: also <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּעַל הַלּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 10:11\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(21,10,11)\">Eccl 10:11</ref> (of serpent-charmer), and <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וַתֵּעֲלוּ עַלשְֿׂפַת ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,3)\">Ezek 36:3</ref>. — On tongue of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> (once), see <b>4</b> below <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> organ of singing, subject of <bdbheb>רָנַן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,16)\">Ps 51:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 126:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"126\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"126\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,126,2)\">Ps 126:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 35:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,35,6)\">Isa 35:6</ref>, <bdbheb>עָנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:172\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"172\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"172\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,172)\">Ps 119:172</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> = <highlight>language</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 28:49\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,49)\">Deut 28:49</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 5:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,15)\">Jer 5:15</ref> and later, namely: <ref re